{"id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dependent-type.md","title":"Set-indexed dependent type","display":"df-dependent-type — Set-indexed dependent type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dependent-type","aliases":["16-df-dependent-type","Dependent type","16-dependent-type"],"display":"df-dependent-type — Set-indexed dependent type","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"§0.2 pp.15–17 (PDF35–37); fixed small value-set presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dependent-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dependent-type</span><span>Dependent type</span><span>16-dependent-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-type — Set-indexed dependent type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§0.2 pp.15–17 (PDF35–37); fixed small value-set presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> (语境集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为候选小集合的集合，其元素直接作为集合读取，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的同一环境宇宙；不另设未声明的解码函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为任意候选集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (本文件定义的依赖类型集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\;\\coloneqq\\;U^\\Gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\;\\coloneqq\\;U^\\Gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\;\\mathsf{type}\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\;\\mathsf{type}\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>集合语义中，语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 上的依赖类型是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 到集合族值域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的函数。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 可为任意小集合的集合，不要求它对依赖积或依赖和封闭。</li>\n<li>来源：§0.2，pp.15–17（PDF35–37）的集合族模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_U\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_U\\)</span> 的固定小值域呈现是本地大小约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_